    "text": " \nWINTER PROGRAM\n \nFRUITS WE HARVEST\n \nFARMING OPERATIONS\n \nOUR HISTORY\n \nCONTACT\nWINTER PROGRAM\n\nRuesga Farms has an exclusive winter program between December – February.\n\nIn the Heart of Puerto Vallarta, MX.\n\nOur winter program farms harvest over 4 million pounds through the months of December to February. All size high-quality watermelons are available along with seeded and seedless variety. The natural weather and rain in the San Vicente and Puerto Vallarta area provide excellent produce flavor, color, and taste!\n\nFeel Free to Contact Our Farmers Today\n\nCONTACT US\n\nContact Ruesga Farms:\n\nHome\n\nWhat We Grow\n\nOur History\n\nContact Us\n\nFollow Us:"
