    "text": " \nWINTER PROGRAM\n \nFRUITS WE HARVEST\n \nFARMING OPERATIONS\n \nOUR HISTORY\n \nCONTACT\nOUR HISTORY\n\nMore than 10 decades later we’ve have grown produce for consumers markets in the US and Mexico.\n\nFarming Since 1920s\n\nOut of the little town of San Vicente, Nayarit a few minutes away from the beautiful beaches of Puerto Vallarta, Ruesga Farms is located. Boasting year-round sunny skies and tropical weather year after year.\n\nThe culture behind our farms is simple, to inspire others and grow quality crop. Our farms are known for growing beans, corn, cucumbers, stevia, and watermelon.\n\nOur establishment has been around since the 1920s with Jose Ruesga a family-man set on a new adventure to start a family farm. Ruesga farms started off with only 10 acres of beans and the determination of a family business to help provide for others.\n\nFeel Free to Contact Our Farmers Today\n\nCONTACT US\n\nContact Ruesga Farms:\n\nHome\n\nWhat We Grow\n\nOur History\n\nContact Us\n\nFollow Us:"
  },
