    "text": " \nWINTER PROGRAM\n \nFRUITS WE HARVEST\n \nFARMING OPERATIONS\n \nOUR HISTORY\n \nCONTACT\nWHAT WE GROW\n\nDelicious Food Grown in San Vicente, MX.\n\nQuality Food & Taste\n\nOur farms harvest over 4 million pounds of watermelon a year. In the near future, we plan to double in size. We grow different varieties of watermelon based on consumer demand. At Ruesga Farms we take pride and joy in serving others.\n\nOur farms are dedicated to providing reliable service along with superior quality among all the products we produce.\n\nWatermelon\nBeans\nStevia\nMango\n\nComing Soon!\n\nCoffee Beans\n\nComing Soon!\n\nCorn\n\nFeel Free to Contact Our Farmers Today\n\nCONTACT US\n\nContact Ruesga Farms:\n\nHome\n\nWhat We Grow\n\nOur History\n\nContact Us\n\nFollow Us:"
