    "text": " \nWINTER PROGRAM\n \nFRUITS WE HARVEST\n \nFARMING OPERATIONS\n \nOUR HISTORY\n \nCONTACT\nFROM OUR FARM\nTo Your Table\n\nFor over 94 years, Ruesga Farms has been farming Watermelons, Beans, and Stevia. Grown with quality and love in the beautiful city of San Vicente, MX.\n\nLEARN MORE\nRuesga Farms\n\nA true family farm, where honesty and integrity continue to grow.\n\nOut of the little town of San Vicente, Nayarit a few minutes away from the beautiful beaches of Puerto Vallarta, Ruesga Farms is located. Boasting year-round sunny skies and tropical weather year after year. The culture behind our farms is simple, to inspire others and grow quality crop. Our family farms were established years ago in the year 1924. Our farms grow beans, corn, cucumbers, stevia, and watermelon.\n\nOUR HISTORY\n\nOur establishment has been around since the 1920s with Jose Ruesga a family-man set on a new adventure to start a family farm. Ruesga farms started off with only 10 acres of beans and the determination of a family business to help provide for others.\n\nMore than 10 decades later we’ve have grown produce for consumers markets in the US and Mexico.\n\nLEARN MORE\nWHAT WE GROW\nSEE WHAT WE GROW\nA LOOK INSIDE OUR FARM\n\nView Our Gallery and get an exclusive look inside Ruesga Farms!\n\nVIEW GALLERY\n\nFeel Free to Contact Our Farmers Today\n\nCONTACT US\n\nContact Ruesga Farms:\n\nHome\n\nWhat We Grow\n\nOur History\n\nContact Us\n\nFollow Us:"
